  "description": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "St Michael's School and Sixth Form is a co-educational independent day and boarding school in Llanelli, Wales, for ages 3-18, part of CATS Global Schools.",
      "The Sixth Form offers A-Levels with 19 subjects including Welsh, Extended Project Qualification (EPQ), Further Maths, Computer Science, and Spanish.",
      "International students require minimum IELTS 5.5 for A-Level entry. Three intakes per year (September, January, April).",
      "Graduates progress to University of Cambridge, top 20 UK universities, and competitive medical, dental, veterinary, engineering, pharmacy, law, and economics programmes."
    ],
    "keyFacts": [
      "Co-educational, ages 3-18",
      "Located in Llanelli, Wales",
      "Part of CATS Global Schools",
      "A-Levels with 19 subjects + EPQ",
      "International tuition £34,590 / year (2-year A-Level)",
      "Three intakes: September, January, April"
    ],
    "paragraphsRu": [
      "St Michael's School and Sixth Form — независимая совместная дневная и пансионная школа в Llanelli (Уэльс) для детей 3-18 лет, часть группы CATS Global Schools.",
      "Sixth Form предлагает A-Levels по 19 предметам, включая Welsh, Extended Project Qualification (EPQ), Further Maths, Computer Science и Spanish.",
      "Иностранным студентам для поступления на A-Level требуется минимум IELTS 5.5. Три набора в год (сентябрь, январь, апрель).",
      "Выпускники поступают в University of Cambridge, топ-20 университетов UK, на конкурсные программы по медицине, стоматологии, ветеринарии, инженерии, фармацевтике, праву и экономике."
    ],
